== Notes ==
* The [[seed|special seed]] KEEP TRAK completely removes the HUD.

== Trivia ==
* "Found HUD" is a reference to '''"Missing HUD"''', an external program that applied this function to Rebirth and Afterbirth.
* {{dlc|r+}} Item Descriptions (also known as Internal Item Descriptions) are a reference to '''External Item Descriptions''', the most subscribed Isaac's Steam Workshop mod, that applied this function to Rebirth, Afterbirth, Afterbirth+, Repentance and Repentance+.

